    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38575" root="مسح" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْسُوحُ الأَلْيَتَيْنِ</span></b>  <i>Having the buttocks cleaving
to the bone, and small.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْسُوحٌ</span> A eunuch
<i>whose testicles have been extirpated.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَضُدٌ مَمْسُوحَةٌ</span> <i>An arm, from the shoulder to the
elbow, having little flesh.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْسُوحُ</span> A
thing <i>foul,</i> or <i>ugly, and unfortunate, and changed
from its proper form,</i> or <i>make.</i> (TA.) [See
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مسخ</span>.]

